bbb-opts opt_shift (-fbbb=h): wrong code, a value still needed past a jump is lost.

The two backward scans stopped at labels but not at jumps. They deleted a
"move.w dy,dx" in front of a conditional branch although the other path reads
dx. Seen with -O2 -m68080 and -O2 -m68020 -mtune=68080. The scans now stop at
jumps too.

--- a/gcc/bbb-opts.c
+++ b/gcc/bbb-opts.c
